<p>
  Hi <%= @minor.first_name || @minor.name %>,
</p>

<p>
  <strong><%= @guardian.name || @guardian.email %></strong> accepted your
  guardian invitation on Fuime.
</p>

<%# Fuime: what their acceptance unblocks differs by money model (L8). Under
    merchant-of-record it clears the guardian half of Event#payout_setup_blockers
    — the destination is still theirs to set up, and activation is Fuime's
    vetting, not this. Under Connect it clears the activation blocker
    (Event::Application#activation_blockers). %>
<p>
  <% if @merchant_of_record %>
    That clears the parent-or-guardian step for getting paid. Once
    <%= @guardian_name %> sets up where the money goes, payouts to your
    business can go ahead.
  <% else %>
    Your venture can now be fully activated. You can accept payments from
    customers, track income and expenses, and keep a record of the business.
  <% end %>
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Go to your dashboard", root_url,
              style: "display:inline-block;background:#2242FF;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 20px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;" %>
</p>

<p style="word-break: break-all;">
  <%= link_to root_url, root_url %>
</p>

<p>
  Questions? Reply to this email or write to <%= @support_email %>.
</p>

<p>
  Thanks,<br>
  The Fuime team
</p>
